    <!--
        Tool and category icons: one Icons8 material-outlined family, every path on a 24x24 box.
        
        Geometry rather than an image asset because Uno rasterises SVG at build time, where
        currentColor has no value to resolve against — so an asset can never follow the theme.
        A PathIcon inherits Foreground, so these recolour for light, dark and High Contrast free.
        
        DataTemplate, not a shared Geometry or PathIconSource. WinUI only converts path
        mini-language on Geometry-typed properties such as Data (never on PathGeometry.Figures,
        which is a WPF affordance) — and a Geometry taken from one resource and assigned to a
        second PathIcon throws ArgumentException, because it is already owned. LoadContent()
        parses a fresh tree per call, so the nav, the card and the tool page each get their own.
    -->

